      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0054:5311063d7fb7053e",
      "arabic": "ذكرها ابن أبي خيثمة، وقال: لا أدري أسلمية هي أم لا؟.\nوأخرج أحمد في المسند، من طريق محمد بن إسحاق، عن محمد بن إبراهيم بن الحارث التيمي: سمعت بقيرة امرأة القعقاع أنها سمعت رسول اللَّه ﷺ يقول: «يا هؤلاء، إذا سمعتم بجيش قد خسف به قريبا فقد أظلّت السّاعة» «١» .\nوأخرجه ابن السّكن من هذا الوجه، وقال: لم يرو عن بقيرة غير هذا الحديث بهذا الإسناد.",
      "english": "Ibn Abi Khaythama mentioned her and said: “I do not know whether she belonged to Aslam or not.”\n\nAhmad narrated in Musnad Ahmad, through Muhammad ibn Ishaq, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith al-Taymi, who said: “I heard Baqira, the wife of al-Qa'qa', say that she heard the Messenger of Allah—may Allah bless him and grant him peace—say: ‘O people, when you hear that an army has been swallowed up nearby, the Hour has drawn near.’” (1)\n\nIbn al-Sakan also narrated it by this route and said: “No hadith other than this one has been narrated from Baqira with this isnad.”",
      "arabic_sha256": "9d74ebb95a3d6fae918429153b26188a90164785f2b2ab7fea3a0a0f385ed085",
      "english_sha256": "c745f61aa6927d2f19db6dad1342f0aa5da8c600e325d7925812c9635a39fbb1",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unresolved"
    }
